	unicon-ui,
	${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: unicon-nographics
Description: Unicon programming language
 Unicon is a modern dialect of the Icon programming language.
 .
 This package depends on the full graphics install: the virtual machine,
 the compiler, the libraries, and the prebuilt tools. It conflicts with
 unicon-nographics.

Package: unicon-nographics
Architecture: all
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.unicon.nographics>
Depends: unicon-runtime-nographics,
	unicon-lib,
	unicon-plugins,
	unicon-translator,
	unicon-compiler,
	unicon-patchstr,
	unicon-ipl,
	unicon-xml,
	unicon-uscribe,
	unicon-udb,
	unicon-ulsp,
	unicon-unidoc,
	unicon-unidep,
	unicon-iyacc,
	unicon-uflex,
	${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: unicon
Description: Unicon programming language, no graphics
 The full Unicon install built around the no-graphics virtual machine:
 compiler, libraries, and the tools that do not draw.
 .
 It does not depend on unicon-gui or unicon-ui. It conflicts with unicon.

Package: unicon-runtime
Architecture: any
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.unicon.nographics>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: unicon-vm
Conflicts: unicon-runtime-nographics
Replaces: unicon-runtime-nographics, unicon (<< 13.3~prerelease-1)
Breaks: unicon (<< 13.3~prerelease-1)
Description: Unicon virtual machine
 The Unicon virtual machine, linked with graphics. The executable
 name is selected by configure.
 .
 Programs that need graphics, including ui and ivib, depend on this
 package. It cannot be installed together with unicon-runtime-nographics.

Package: unicon-runtime-nographics
Architecture: any
Build-Profiles: <pkg.unicon.nographics>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: unicon-vm
Conflicts: unicon-runtime
Replaces: unicon-runtime, unicon (<< 13.3~prerelease-1)
Breaks: unicon (<< 13.3~prerelease-1)
Description: Unicon virtual machine, no graphics
 The Unicon virtual machine built with --disable-graphics and
 --disable-audio. Same executable name as unicon-runtime, linked
 without the graphics and audio libraries.
 .
 It cannot be installed together with unicon-runtime. The compiler and
 the tools that do not draw accept either package.

Package: unicon-plugins
Architecture: any
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.unicon.nographics>
Depends: unicon-runtime | unicon-runtime-nographics, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Replaces: unicon (<< 13.3~prerelease-1)
Breaks: unicon (<< 13.3~prerelease-1)
Description: Unicon loadable C functions and plugins
 libcfunc.so, which loadfunc() searches for, and the loadable plugins.
 Not required to run the virtual machine. Either runtime can load them.

Package: unicon-lib
Architecture: any
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.unicon.nographics>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Replaces: unicon (<< 13.3~prerelease-1)
Breaks: unicon (<< 13.3~prerelease-1)
Description: Unicon class library
 The class library under uni/lib. A program that imports it needs this
 package. Prebuilt tools already have those modules linked in.

Package: unicon-translator
Architecture: any
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.unicon.nographics>
Depends: unicon-lib, unicon-runtime | unicon-runtime-nographics, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Replaces: unicon (<< 13.3~prerelease-1)
Breaks: unicon (<< 13.3~prerelease-1)
Description: Unicon translator
 The unicon front end and the translator. The translator
 executable name is selected by configure.
 Also ships the translator files under uni/parser.
 .
 Depends on unicon-lib and either virtual machine. unicon-runtime is
 preferred when neither is installed.

Package: unicon-compiler
Architecture: any
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.unicon.nographics>
Depends: unicon-runtime | unicon-runtime-nographics, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Replaces: unicon (<< 13.3~prerelease-1)
Breaks: unicon (<< 13.3~prerelease-1)
Description: Unicon compiler
 The compiler that translates Unicon to C. The executable name is
 selected by configure. Also ships rt/, the library and headers used
 when compiling.
 .
 Depends on either virtual machine. unicon-runtime is preferred when
 neither is installed.

Package: unicon-patchstr
Architecture: any
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.unicon.nographics>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Replaces: unicon (<< 13.3~prerelease-1)
Breaks: unicon (<< 13.3~prerelease-1)
Description: Unicon binary path patcher
 patchstr writes an install prefix into Unicon executables.
 .
 Debian and RPM packages run it while the package is built, after
 the final /usr paths are known and before the files are split.
 Each package then contains its own already-patched binaries. This
 package does not patch other packages after installation.
 The Windows installer runs patchstr at install time, because the
 directory is chosen then.

