Replaces: unicon (<< 13.3~prerelease-1)
Breaks: unicon (<< 13.3~prerelease-1)
Description: Unicon program library
 The Icon Program Library shipped with Unicon. For programs that link
 it. Prebuilt tools do not need this package.

